      "content": "I understand that in this moment, professional help might feel inadequate against such immense pressure. A therapist's role isn't to change your family, but to help *you* build internal boundaries and resilience against those external forces. They can offer tools to manage the feeling of being trapped and help you find pockets of authentic self-expression where your voice can be heard. If the feeling of being trapped becomes overwhelming, please reach out immediately to a crisis line.",
      "source": "target",
